# Smoke test for picture. On host the SD-card stub's tf.listDir returns
# nullptr, so the app's first process tick takes the
# `if (NULL == image_file) sys->app_exit()` path. This scenario just
# asserts init + that auto-exit + a follow-up RETURN don't crash.

app picture

wait_ms 400
screenshot 01_initial
assert_no_crash

action RETURN
wait_ms 200
assert_no_crash
